  "title": "· IN-BAG | Louis Vuitton's First Beauty Capsule: Monogram Canvas Inspired ·",
  "original_title": "IN-BAG | Louis Vuitton 发布首个美妆限定联名系列：Monogram 帆布灵感",
  "excerpt": "Louis Vuitton launches two limited beauty collections, blending nude elegance and bold black-red, inspired by its iconic Monogram canvas.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-09-07",
  "date_label": "September 07, 2026",
