    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton has just unveiled its first-ever limited-edition beauty collaboration, crafted by Beauty Creative Director Pat McGrath and Women's Artistic Director Nicolas Ghesquière. Inspired by the iconic Monogram canvas, the Monogram Dune collection centers on soft beige and nude tones, evoking a poetic, gentle femininity, while the Monogram Infrarouge collection pairs deep black with bold red to celebrate fearless, daring women.",
