    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The women of Dune—warm and soft—and those of Infrarouge—bold and passionate—are both authentic selves. They represent who we are at different moments in life, under different lights. I have always admired the women Nicolas creates because they are never one-dimensional. They are complex, multifaceted, even contradictory, yet always true to themselves. — Dame Pat McGrath, Creative Director of Louis Vuitton Beauty",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
