    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Monogram Dune — Poetry in Light ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/v64421y/613f77585459331e.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/v64421y/7f3671adc49bf60d.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Monogram Dune collection embodies quiet strength and luminous poetry. Inspired by ever-shifting desert landscapes, its palette blends soft beige with sun-warmed nude tones. Three makeup essentials debut here: LV Rogue lipstick in 110, LV Baume tinted lip balm in 010, and LV Ombres eye palette in 150. Their earthy, fine-milled shimmer imparts a subtle warmth, celebrating a woman's tender grace and natural beauty.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
