    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Monogram Infrarouge collection conjures a world of fearless confidence. Inspired by the dramatic Monogram Infrarouge canvas, it pairs deep black with intense red for a striking contrast. Three products—LV Rogue lipstick in 854, LV Baume in 050, and LV Ombres eye palette in 896—command attention with their vivid juxtaposition.",
