      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For the first time, Monogram canvas wraps the cosmetics cases, seamlessly bridging the house's fashion heritage and its beauty universe. The Dune collection features warm rose-gold hardware on matte ivory aluminum cases, while Infrarouge opts for deep matte black with delicate red lacquer. All eyeshadows, lipsticks, and balms come with refillable cores, underscoring a commitment to sustainability.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
